@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam dpi 150
left to right direction
title DGM-USECASE-04 检索与详情
actor "访客" as Visitor
rectangle "CognitaNexus" {
 usecase "UC-01 检索成果与学者" as Search
 usecase "UC-02 查看成果详情与来源" as Detail
 usecase "UC-03 浏览学者门户" as Portal
}
Visitor -- Search
Visitor -- Detail
Visitor -- Portal
note bottom
当前V1.1；角色关系表示职责，不用继承表达账号状态。
认证及授权为守卫，不画作强制调用用例。O01/O02延期。
end note
@enduml
